<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 4.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 4.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on March 3.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   RIC	 Yield     Close</p>
<p>1   Consol Rutile	 155.77     1.04</p>
<p>2   Telecasters Nqld     15.84     5.05</p>
<p>3   Bk of Queen	    13.85     5.85</p>
